{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "456ad5a382521f5b",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Riese Auto Clinic Mockups/mockups/01-vehicle-status.png",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844
    },
    {
      "id": "04b71feae35ba0a9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Vehicle status (customer)\n`customer_status_screen.dart`\n- Opened with a reference code, no login\n- Read-only: phase, parts used, work done (no prices)\n- Updates live when staff change the phase\n- Pull down to refresh as a fallback\n- Tapping a push notification lands here",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "28f8e444201b3e4f",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Riese Auto Clinic Mockups/mockups/02-role-choice.png",
      "x": 590,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844
    },
    {
      "id": "05566167ed479eb9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Entry: role choice\n`role_choice_screen.dart`\n- \"I'm a customer\" goes to the reference-code lookup\n- \"I work here\" goes to staff sign-in (`login_screen.dart`)",
      "x": 590,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "a864f0d378439bb3",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Riese Auto Clinic Mockups/mockups/03-home.png",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844
    },
    {
      "id": "d1d148031704ea78",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Home\n`home_screen.dart`\n- Shows the signed-in role (Admin or Mechanic)\n- Shortcuts: View bookings, Stock\n- Sign-out sits in the top bar\n- **Design idea, not built yet:** the \"3 open jobs / 1 low stock\" strip",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "56f1d8eb1993f37f",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Riese Auto Clinic Mockups/mockups/04-bookings-list.png",
      "x": 1770,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844
    },
    {
      "id": "9176bbf330e2d466",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Bookings list\n`bookings_list_screen.dart`\n- Search by invoice number\n- Tabs: Open and Completed\n- Each card: vehicle, registration, km, invoice number\n- **Design idea, not built yet:** the coloured phase tag on each card",
      "x": 1770,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "69f36dc57ad4707e",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Riese Auto Clinic Mockups/mockups/05-booking-detail.png",
      "x": 2360,
      "y": -142,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 1127
    },
    {
      "id": "4979c13f4fe09dac",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Booking details\n`booking_detail_screen.dart`\n- Phase is a dropdown in the app today; the step tracker is a **design idea**\n- Finalize, Delete and Reopen are admin-only\n- Parts and labor can be added or removed while the booking is open\n- Labor = hours x rate (default R350/h)",
      "x": 2360,
      "y": 1041,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 330
    },
    {
      "id": "d5d3db1765287eef",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Riese Auto Clinic: app mockups\nDark theme with gold, green and orange accents. Phone layout, 390 px wide.\n\n**Staff:** role choice, then Home, then Bookings list, then Booking details\n**Customer:** role choice, then Vehicle status (reference code, no login)\n\nThe screens are images in `mockups/`. The notes, palette and arrows are ordinary canvas cards, so edit, move or add to them freely.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -600,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "9366282e11c15155",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## How the colours are used\n- **Gold**: brand and main actions (buttons, add button, active tab, \"Checked in\" tag)\n- **Green**: done or positive (completed steps, \"Ready for pickup\", vehicle icons)\n- **Orange**: active or needs attention (current phase, \"Labor in progress\", low-stock count)\n- Dark text on gold buttons; white icons on green and orange fills",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -310,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "5ca5a8d02077b7f6",
